{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-25T06:39:22.967Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"bde5973a64851be416b1c911","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1777","claim:pm-gh1778","claim:pm-gh1780","lineage:pm-gh1778","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1777+pm-gh1778+pm-gh1780","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1777","claim:pm-gh1778","claim:pm-gh1780","lineage:pm-gh1778","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-25T06:39:22.967Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-25T06:39:22.966Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation: pm package manage records what each answered freshness check saw in the untracked runtime/extension-update-observations.json of its scope (failed or timed-out lookups record nothing and keep the earlier observation; a failed write only warns extension_update_observation_write_failed). pm context reads the observations offline: rows {name,scope,version,status,update,shadowed_by}, summary updates_available plus next (one pm package upgrade command per scope) only when the count is above zero; an observation applies only to the installed version it was taken against. Sandbox reproduction of the report (pm-github project 2026.10.4 + global 2026.10.14, observed 2026.11.23): global row shadowed_by project, project row update 2026.11.23, next pm package upgrade pm-github --project. Companion finding: human recovery prints a legal domain of 12 or fewer values whole at the unbudgeted limit, so pm context --section bogus lists all 10 sections; budgeted renderings keep their limits. Cost, from the context-intent calibration report (accepted update): context intent 770 to 793 tokens (2-item fixture) and 1,038 to 1,084 (2,243-item fixture), session orientation 3,495 to 3,518 and 8,182 to 8,205 of 20,000; context stays inside its declared 3,000-token budget."}]}],"before_hash":"065f7f315f94a74adfe22ea361cc8b13a4ea0821c0cd30ac1ca2f3ca7346e293","after_hash":"6499de9c19ffbd55adedf55412ed5a6edb9af6a37d2763e83f66ad63785da9f3","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"b93eacb748d79901160cea2e8bd50eee43b8999cd05936c0a6211d81745c2fa4"}
