{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-25T08:10:08.011Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"bde5973a64851be416b1c911","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-25T08:10:08.011Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review round 1 (Codex gpt-6.2-sol xhigh: 2 P1, 9 P2, 3 P3; Greptile 4 P2; CodeRabbit 2 minor), all verified against the code and fixed. Observation identity: rows now carry installed_updated_at (the managed record updated_at, which install/upgrade advances whenever the version or source changes), so a commit-only GitHub upgrade retires the observation (Codex P2, Greptile, CodeRabbit). Downgrade guard: a registry latest not newer than the installed version (compareComparableVersions) is recorded as no update. Concurrency: the read-merge-write runs under a per-scope lock (locks/extension-update-observations.lock, 2 s wait, failure only warns) and the later checked_at wins per package (Codex P2, Greptile). File safety: only a bounded (1 MiB) regular file in a real runtime/ directory is read; a link, FIFO or non-directory runtime reads as no knowledge and is never written through (Codex P2). Context: updates_available and next count only the copy the runtime loads (effective layer+directory), so a disabled copy keeps its row but earns no hint (Codex P2, Greptile); hints are rendered from argv with renderPmCommand, keep the selected tracker via resolvePmCommandScopeArgs, and put a dash-leading name after -- (Codex P1 + P2). updates_available is optional on StaticExtensionInventoryResult (always emitted) so SDK fixtures keep type-checking (Codex P3)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-25T08:10:08.011Z"}],"before_hash":"9a0bd5b1c326b87adf029b4f77fb3bb6437ac20339ac132c99c943ea1efa2cfc","after_hash":"360a98f147b6c2a766d231d47cba1bebc6d38738f05294450282478b9cd0517b","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"937ce60a7e65d81cb691e280b8c99d11f76306bef8ccb13b45c5ce1f607db7df"}
