{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-25T11:09:26.655Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"bde5973a64851be416b1c911","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-25T11:09:26.655Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review round 4 (Codex: 1 P1, 5 P2, 4 P3; Greptile 1; CodeRabbit 3). Fixed: one SemVer verdict for manage and the offline readers (checkNpmUpdate now uses isNewerRegistryVersion, so an older registry latest is no update anywhere, and the collector records the provider verdict as is); npm sources are classified with npm-package-arg plus archive-path rules (bare tarballs, artifacts/pkg.tgz, name@file:, git and URL specs are never registry sources), shared with upgrade source selection; check times more than five minutes ahead read as clock errors; Markdown puts multi-line hints in a fenced block; docs and types describe updates_available and shadowed_by as static selection, not activation truth. Not changed, with reason (second report): runtime/ replaced between the post-lock recheck and the write needs a process that can already rewrite the tracker's own runtime state; Node has no directory-relative file API, and the lifecycle doc now states that residual window instead of promising full confinement."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-25T11:09:26.655Z"}],"before_hash":"ef39a2582cdd5b99c9d8a0ba0862077bb817d62fe74b5dde26768678e1928934","after_hash":"047dedc9c830d1e61cfa63ada2f90e05f14b4d58f8e456b19bfc5d839079ec5c","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7faf641252e665c183af13329a684aac48e2809c082a557c697a38b2a0102bc7"}
