{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-25T12:13:17.221Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"bde5973a64851be416b1c911","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-25T12:13:17.221Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review round 5 (Codex: 1 P1, 3 P2, 3 P3; CodeRabbit 2). Fixed: the observation merge keeps every new answer when managed state is unreadable mid-write (a concurrent lifecycle write), latest per installation, and prunes on the next complete snapshot, instead of discarding the run's answers; rows with a wrong-typed remote_version and records with another envelope version read as no knowledge; checkNpmUpdate and the GitHub check stamp checked_at at completion (the documented contract), so the newest-wins merge orders overlapping checks by when they finished. Follow-up filed: pm-4qq9jy owns recording whether an npm install resolved to a local directory (npm:plugin with a local plugin directory), which needs new managed-source provenance and also affects live manage and upgrade. Not changed, with reason (third report): redirecting runtime/ after the post-lock recheck needs a process that can already rewrite this tracker's runtime state; the write is a fixed-name, pm-generated JSON file; Node has no directory-relative file API; the lifecycle doc states the residual window. Atomic managed-state publication was tried and reverted: it changes the install rollback contract that tests pin, which is outside this PR."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-25T12:13:17.221Z"}],"before_hash":"4b8635634b9ed11b968d154221abf5a60e2caaa466b003432a28d20b149e4d1f","after_hash":"06bc762c6d991bf8707740ff8fb662608547ea04c4066d276d19ea654210658f","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"711f195e8922f5ec238d9aa418ef4b6c8446f04db4f8cbedf1bb7938b96b32ff"}
